<title>LATVIA: Most Latvian T-bill rates rise at auction.</title>
<headline>Most Latvian T-bill rates rise at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on Latvian Treasury bills rose in most maturities on Wednesday, with only the 12-month rate dipping, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	 10.14	10.07	  0.75   0.78  0.34</p>
<p> 91-day	 10.20	10.13	  1.0    0.54  0.40</p>
<p> 182-day	11.53	11.44	  2.0    2.17  2.0</p>
<p> one-year     12.76	12.80	  1.25   2.52  1.25</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
